OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable cloud during the day
OL,6,Fwith some bright or sunny spells
OL,7,Fbreaking through at times. It will be
OL,8,Fmostly dry but the odd light shower is
OL,9,Fpossible.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry through the
OL,12,Fevening with variable cloud and some
OL,13,Fbright then clear spells. Clouding
OL,14,Fover through the night with outbreaks
OL,15,Fof rain, turning heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
