OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudy and increasingly
OL,6,Fbreezy morning with occasionally heavy
OL,7,Frain. Staying mostly cloudy through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon with further rain or
OL,9,Fshowers, heavy at times, but the odd
OL,10,Fbrighter spell possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of occasionally heavy
OL,14,Frain on Wednesday, likely turning
OL,15,Fdrier later with some bright spells
OL,16,Fand showers. Bright spells and
OL,17,Fscattered showers on Thursday and
OL,18,FFriday.
